 href=\"?note=c29895adfd4058b0\" title=\"73-df-abstract-family-of-languages\">73-df-abstract-family-of-languages</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"705cd151c71b2488\" href=\"?note=705cd151c71b2488\" title=\"73-thm-regular-homomorphism-closure\">73-thm-regular-homomorphism-closure</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"0a8ae928e41627d1\" href=\"?note=0a8ae928e41627d1\" title=\"73-thm-cfl-inverse-homomorphism\">73-thm-cfl-inverse-homomorphism</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"52160274657632e4\" href=\"?note=52160274657632e4\" title=\"73-thm-recursive-and-re-closure\">73-thm-recursive-and-re-closure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"source_ref","html":"Lemma 11.1, pp. 271–272; §11.4, p. 278; scans 279–280, 286"},{"key":"source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"reviewed_on","html":"2026-10-24"},{"key":"legacy_source_id","html":"HU1979"},{"key":"legacy_source_ref","html":"Lemma 11.1, pp. 271–272; §11.4, p. 278; scans 279–280, 286"},{"key":"legacy_source_status","html":"book-based-local-formalization"},{"key":"revision_round","html":"pdf-third-edition-20261024"},{"key":"edition_role","html":"outside-third-edition"},{"key":"third_edition_relation","html":"新版之外的拓展；保留真实旧版或独立文献来源，不归入第三版正文。"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"23b25eb6ccba1a53\" href=\"?note=23b25eb6ccba1a53\" title=\"73-df-standard-language-families\">73-df-standard-language-families</a> 的族对象及 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"c29895adfd4058b0\" href=\"?note=c29895adfd4058b0\" title=\"73-df-abstract-family-of-languages\">73-df-abstract-family-of-languages</a> 的封闭谓词。相关具体封闭见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"705cd151c71b2488\" href=\"?note=705cd151c71b2488\" title=\"73-thm-regular-homomorphism-closure\">73-thm-regular-homomorphism-closure</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"0a8ae928e41627d1\" href=\"?note=0a8ae928e41627d1\" title=\"73-thm-cfl-inverse-homomorphism\">73-thm-cfl-inverse-homomorphism</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"52160274657632e4\" href=\"?note=52160274657632e4\" title=\"73-thm-recursive-and-re-closure\">73-thm-recursive-and-re-closure</a>。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathfrak L\">\\(\\mathcal F\\subseteq\\mathfrak L\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smallest\\text{-}trios\\text{-}and\\text{-}afls}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Trio}(\\mathcal F)\\Longrightarrow\\mathsf{RegAll}_{+}\\subseteq\\mathcal F,\\qquad\\operatorname{FullTrio}(\\mathcal F)\\Longrightarrow\\mathsf{RegAll}\\subseteq\\mathcal F\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smallest\\text{-}trios\\text{-}and\\text{-}afls}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{Trio}(\\mathcal F)\\Longrightarrow\\mathsf{RegAll}_{+}\\subseteq\\mathcal F,\\qquad\\operatorname{FullTrio}(\\mathcal F)\\Longrightarrow\\mathsf{RegAll}\\subseteq\\mathcal F\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smallest\\text{-}trios\\text{-}and\\text{-}afls}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{AFL}(\\mathsf{RegAll}_{+})\\land\\operatorname{FullAFL}(\\mathsf{RegAll})\\land\\operatorname{FullAFL}(\\mathsf{CFAll})\\land\\operatorname{FullAFL}(\\mathsf{REAll})\\land\\operatorname{Trio}(\\mathsf{DecAll})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}smallest\\text{-}trios\\text{-}and\\text{-}afls}\\vdash\n\\operatorname{AFL}(\\mathsf{RegAll}_{+})\\land\\operatorname{FullAFL}(\\mathsf{RegAll})\\land\\operatorname{FullAFL}(\\mathsf{CFAll})\\land\\operatorname{FullAFL}(\\mathsf{REAll})\\land\\operatorname{Trio}(\\mathsf{DecAll})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p><strong>版本归属：新版之外的拓展。</strong> 本条不作为所提供第三版 PDF 的正文陈述；原始来源以 source_id/source_ref 为准。</p>\n<p>从族中的一个非空语言取词 w，利用逆同态插入新字符，再用非擦除同态和正则交得到所有不含 ε 的正则语言；full trio 可用擦除得到 ε。各标准族的封闭由对应机器/文法构造得到。可判定语言只列 trio，未宣称对任意擦除同态封闭。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"73-df-standard-language-families","status":"resolved","id":"23b25eb6ccba1a53","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-standard-language-families]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-abstract-family-of-languages","status":"resolved","id":"c29895adfd4058b0","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-df-abstract-family-of-languages]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-regular-homomorphism-closure","status":"resolved","id":"705cd151c71b2488","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-regular-homomorphism-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-cfl-inverse-homomorphism","status":"resolved","id":"0a8ae928e41627d1","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-cfl-inverse-homomorphism]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-thm-recursive-and-re-closure","status":"resolved","id":"52160274657632e4","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[73-thm-recursive-and-re-closure]]","embed":false},{"target":"73-df-standard-language-families","status":"resolved","id":"23b25eb6ccba1a53","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"使用 [[73-df-standard-language-families]] 的族对象及 [[73-df-abstract-family-of-languages]] 的封闭谓词。相关具体封闭见 [[73-thm-regular-homomorphism-closure]]、[[73-thm-cfl-inverse-ho